WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.100
- So your mom was musical, right?

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.760
- My mom actually moved to
California chasing my father

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.293
and she came with a guitar.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.353
- [Kelly] And a dream.

00:00:09.353 --> 00:00:10.186
- And a dream.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:14.040
Yeah, she always wanted to sing.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.190
She made a little 45
when she first got here.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.810
That was a long time ago children.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.710
- [Kelly] Is that her?

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.240
- Oh yeah, that's my mother's singing.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.230
- [Kelly] Look at this character.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.180
I love her and I want that hat.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:28.040
- That's my mother trying
to sing "Old Town Road."

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.580
(kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.800
I don't know if the road is old or new

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.150
but I don't wanna be on it.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.600
- Did she sing like that
all the time, just randomly?

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.310
- Well, you know what ends up happening,

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.990
in my house from Mother's Day,

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.660
the kids always do a talent show for me

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.100
because I perform for the world.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.134
I'm like, "Y'all get up there
and do something for me."

00:00:47.134 --> 00:00:48.134
- I love that.

00:00:48.134 --> 00:00:49.202
- I love that too.
(audience applause)

00:00:49.202 --> 00:00:52.033
- I make them do it.

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:53.982
- With a smile, "I make them do it."

00:00:53.982 --> 00:00:54.900
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.300
- And my mother never wants to be left out

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.150
so sometimes she'll get in on the act.

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:01.653
- She's a grab the mic mama.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.230
Oh, I love that kind of mom.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.063
- Very much.

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:06.090
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:08.440
This is where the
personality came, okay, okay.

